OL,3,GNEWSACost of tackling huge summer
OL,4,Awildfire revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe financial cost to Cambridgeshire's
OL,7,Ffire service for tackling the major
OL,8,Fsummer wildfire at Holme Fen is due to
OL,9,Fbe more than #750,000, board papers
OL,10,Fhave revealed.
OL,12,FThe papers, published ahead of a
OL,13,Fmeeting of the Cambridgeshire and
OL,14,FPeterborough Fire Authority this
OL,15,FWednesday, outlined the cost, as dozens
OL,16,Fof firefighters spent a month tackling
OL,17,Fthe woodland and peatland blaze.
OL,19,FThey said #336,000 had been spent so
OL,20,Ffar, but the total did not include all
OL,21,Fthe third-party support costs that have
OL,22,Fyet to be received.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
