OL,3,GNEWSACost of tackling huge summer
OL,4,Awildfire revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The overall total is expected to
OL,7,Fexceed #750k and we expect to be able
OL,8,Fto reclaim this in the form of a
OL,9,Fwildfire grant [from government]," said
OL,10,Fthe documents.
